  // design: The Fort Ring with its middle (south-west, turned with it) a gateway: 4.4 m between the piers' inner faces along the wall, 3 m clear under a lintel as thick as the wall, the piers 0.8 m wide standing 0.3 m proud of both faces and 0.3 m over the wall's top. A slit either side of the gate covers the approach.
